#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:47
msgid ""
"Receives security updates for years. Best choice for most users — reliable "
"and well-tested."
msgstr ""
"Får säkerhetsuppdateringar i flera år. Bästa valet för de flesta användare —"
" pålitlig och vältestad."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:53
msgid "Low-latency, real-time"
msgstr "Låg latens, realtid"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:56
msgid ""
"Designed for audio/video production and tasks needing precise timing. May be"
" incompatible with some drivers (e.g. NVIDIA). Only recommended for advanced"
" users."
msgstr ""
"Designad för ljud-/videoproduktion och uppgifter som kräver exakt timing. "
"Kan vara inkompatibel med vissa drivrutiner (t.ex. NVIDIA). Rekommenderas "
"endast för avancerade användare."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:63
msgid "Gaming & performance optimized"
msgstr "Optimerad för spel och prestanda"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:66
msgid ""
"Tuned for faster gaming and a more responsive desktop. Great for daily use "
"if you want extra performance."
msgstr ""
"Justera för snabbare spel och ett mer responsivt skrivbord. Perfekt för "
"dagligt bruk om du vill ha extra prestanda."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:72
msgid "Performance optimized by CachyOS"
msgstr "Prestanda optimerad av CachyOS"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:75
msgid ""
"EEVDF scheduler with LTO, AutoFDO and Propeller optimizations. Excellent for"
" gaming and desktop responsiveness."
msgstr ""
"EEVDF-schemaläggare med LTO, AutoFDO och Propeller-optimeringar. Utmärkt för"
" spel och skrivbordsresponsivitet."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:84
msgid ""
"BigCommunity kernel (big-kernel), optimized for gaming and general use "
"(BORE, Clang ThinLTO, Intel fixes)"
msgstr ""
"BigCommunity-kärna (big-kernel), optimerad för spel och allmän användning "
"(BORE, Clang ThinLTO, Intel-fixar)"

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:90
msgid ""
"Official kernel.org kernel with Manjaro's configuration and patches, plus "
"the BORE scheduler, Clang + ThinLTO build and fixes for recent Intel GPUs "
"(Arrow Lake / Meteor Lake)."
msgstr ""
"Officiell kernel.org-kärna med Manjaros konfiguration och patchar, plus "
"BORE-schemaläggaren, en Clang + ThinLTO-build och fixar för nyare Intel-"
"GPU:er (Arrow Lake / Meteor Lake)."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_card_builder.py:100
